eu4dll (0.2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Require LDC >= 1.43 to build: the source uses the LDC 1.43
    naked asm form, and older compilers fail at link time. The
    build now stops early with a readable message instead.
  * Bundle the LDC shared runtime (libphobos and libdruntime) in
    /usr/lib/eu4dll and set the library rpath to $ORIGIN, so the
    installed package does not depend on a system D runtime.

 -- muse <muse@localhost>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:15:00 +0900

eu4dll (0.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian package: preload library, eu4dll_translations mod
    data (localisation and generated fonts), and the eu4dll-launch
    and eu4dll-install-mod helper scripts.

 -- muse <muse@localhost>  Sat, 22 Nov 2026 07:50:00 +0900
